  "details": "I would like to do something sightly different than another similar sounding request. https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/display-avatar-performance-ranking-on-avatar-pedestals would have more information show up in the stands.\n\nI would like to have user option for performance levels that are acceptable on a per platform basis, so in my specific case I'd like to select \"poor\" for both PC and quest, and if I see an avatar in my favorites that is very poor on quest, I'd like to either see it shown as not having quest support, or maybe a way to show that quest support isnt good enough.",
